<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fresh Cut — Frizerie</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.65), rgba(0,0,0,.8)),
                url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503951914875-452162b0f3f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80")
                center/cover;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 64px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .buton {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #d4af37;
            color: #111;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        section {
            padding: 70px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .servicii {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .serviciu {
            background: #222;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .serviciu h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .pret {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .galerie {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .galerie img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 280px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .program {
            background: #222;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        footer {
            background: #080808;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 44px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div>
        <h1>✂️ Fresh Cut</h1>
        <p>Stilul tău. Tunsoarea ta.</p>

        <a class="buton" href="https://wa.me/373XXXXXXXX" target="_blank">
            Programează-te 📱
        </a>
    </div>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>Serviciile noastre</h2>

    <div class="servicii">

        <div class="serviciu">
            <h3>Tuns</h3>
            <p>Tunsoare modernă pentru bărbați</p>
            <p class="pret">100 lei</p>
        </div>

        <div class="serviciu">
            <h3>Tuns + Barbă</h3>
            <p>Tuns și aranjat barba</p>
            <p class="pret">150 lei</p>
        </div>

        <div class="serviciu">
            <h3>Aranjat Barbă</h3>
            <p>Contur și îngrijire</p>
            <p class="pret">70 lei</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Lucrările noastre 🔥</h2>

    <div class="galerie">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622286342621-4bd786c2447c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
             alt="Tunsoare">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431202-1e0f0d8f0c7d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
             alt="Frizerie">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621605815971-fbc98d665033?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
             alt="Tunsoare modernă">

    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Despre noi</h2>

    <p>
        La Fresh Cut combinăm stilul modern cu atenția la detalii.
        Vino pentru o tunsoare, o barbă îngrijită și o experiență relaxantă.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Program 🕐</h2>

    <div class="program">
        <p>Luni – Sâmbătă: 09:00 – 19:00</p>
        <p>Duminică: Închis</p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Fresh Cut — Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
